{"data":{"description":"Metal Pipe is a component used in 26 recipes, such as Rockets, Mortar Shells, [SAM Ammo](/items/sam-ammo), the Flame Thrower and the Salvaged Axe. Get pipes from [road signs](/world/roadsign), which always drop 1, or buy 1 for 30 scrap at [Outpost](/monument/outpost). Locked and Elite Crates can drop 5-15. A tier 3 workbench crafts one for 2 HQM and 20 scrap. In a Green Recycler it gives 5 scrap and 1 HQM.","item":{"id":"metalpipe","name":"Metal Pipe","path":"/v1/items/metal-pipe.json","slug":"metal-pipe"},"name":"Metal Pipe","path":"/v1/recycler/metalpipe.json","recyclers":[{"guaranteed":[{"amount":7,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":50,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-red","name":"Red Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-red.json","slug":"recycler-red"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":6,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":20,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green-powered","name":"Green Recycler (powered)","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green-powered.json","slug":"recycler-green-powered"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":5,"item":{"id":"scrap","name":"Scrap","path":"/v1/items/scrap.json","slug":"scrap"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green","name":"Green